Package: ICAnalysis
Title: Analysis of Illumina Connected Annotations Variant Data
Version: 0.99.0
Date: 2026-08-08
Authors@R: 
    person(
        "Marco Antonio",
        "Campanário",
        email = "macscampanario@gmail.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Provides tools for cohort-level analysis of genetic variant
    annotations parsed from Illumina Connected Annotations JSON files with
    AnnoJSON. The package operates on ICAPositions objects and supports
    allele-level transformation, population-database classification,
    allele-frequency classification, and clinical annotation summaries.
License: Artistic-2.0
